        "subject": "LU-20276 zfs: update ZFS to 2.4.3",
        "message": "LU-20276 zfs: update ZFS to 2.4.3\n\nUpdate ZFS to the 2.4.3 release to include some bug fixes that\nmay fix the OOM issue seen in sanityn due to large sparse files.\n\nThe full list of new changes in this release are at:\nhttps://github.com/openzfs/zfs/releases/tag/zfs-2.4.1\nhttps://github.com/openzfs/zfs/releases/tag/zfs-2.4.2\nhttps://github.com/openzfs/zfs/releases/tag/zfs-2.4.3\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial testlist=sanity fstype=zfs\nTest-Parameters: testlist=sanityn fstype=zfs serverdistro=el9.7\nTest-Parameters: testlist=sanityn fstype=zfs serverdistro=el9.8\nTest-Parameters: testlist=sanityn fstype=zfs serverdistro=el10.1\nTest-Parameters: optional testlist=sanityn fstype=zfs serverdistro=el10.2\nTest-Parameters: testlist=conf-sanity fstype=zfs\nSigned-off-by: Andreas Dilger <adilger@thelustrecollective.com>\nChange-Id: I67dd6aa5f3544d0e8f1695975da5ed880b3ebbe5\n"
